OL,3,ADiesel hits #2 a litre in UK for first
OL,4,Atime, as US pressures Europe to release
OL,5,Areserves
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump says he may
OL,8,Fask European countries to release
OL,9,Fdiesel reserves as he considers banning
OL,10,FUS exports of the fuel
OL,12,FThe move could bring prices down
OL,13,Fsignificantly for American drivers, but
OL,14,Fexperts warn it would put further
OL,15,Fpressure on diesel prices in other
OL,16,Fcountries
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
